import QtQuick

// Mosaic OS: a pixel symbol from the mosaic-ui (the Mosaic Store's identity,
// mosaic-ui/js/simbolos.js): a hand-drawn 9 × 9 grid, "#" is a lit pixel. The
// Mosaic theme's widgets use them as their marks; extra ones (calendario, nuvem,
// wifi, bluetooth, volume, ampulheta, barras, faisca, git, chip, and for the
// sidebars cafe, energia, celular) were drawn here
// on the same grid. Sizes in multiples of 9 keep every pixel whole.
